     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Tumble Twin has two clown towers in Crazy Pink and Banana Yellow, joined by a rope bridge, with slides on each side and a climbing panel to get up. The two-tower plan lets children chase each other from one end to the other, which is why it suits school breaks and busy society evenings. It is meant for children aged 5 to 12, and play covers climbing, sliding and hanging. The product area is 34' x 17'7\", with a safe play area of 40' x 22'7\". The narrow width makes it a good choice for a side lawn or a strip of open ground between buildings. Capacity is listed as 15 children. For Tumble Twin, the galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope are under a 3-year warranty. Send us your measurements and we will confirm the fit."
